# "beam <subject> up": return it to its owner's hand to pay the portion of a beam me up cost that
# requires returning a creature you control, the verb beam me up defines for itself
# [CR#702.196b]. It is done by returning, so "can't be beamed up" forbids that return and no
# other. Named apart from `beamMeUp`, the keyword ability.
action beamUp(subject: NounPhrase) {
  ofAbility = beamMeUp,
  spelling = "beam <subject> up",
  body = returnToHand($subject)
}
